<title>USA: CBOE to list LEAPS on Allstate Corp.</title>
<headline>CBOE to list LEAPS on Allstate Corp.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Board Options Exchange (CBOE) said it will list long-term equity anticipation securities (LEAPS) on Allstate Corp shares on December 13.</p>
<p>The LEAPS, which are basically long-term options, will have initial strike prices of 50, 60 and 70, with expirations in January 1998 and January 1999.</p>
<p>RMB &amp; Associates LP will be the designated primary market maker, a CBOE spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>((DerivativesDesk312-408-8750 E-mail:derivatives@reuters.com))</p>
